{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t今年亞太經合組織工商領導人峰會，將於本月17至18日，在深圳前海舉行，國家主席習近平與11個APEC經濟體領導代表將出席，習近平將於峰會開幕式發表主旨演講。<br/>\n<br/>\n中國貿促會表示，過百間世界500強企業代表將參與。另外，峰會將首次以倡議形式發布成果文件。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：劉景輝\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:20:47.816140+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:53:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T20:20:49.730124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T12:14:28.999086+00:00","content_hash":"e7f6589d1503fb41d0c79bec12da5503933e0d7bcf1e06ded13ef55bfd9a2fde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}